    "From the repository root: ./Scripts/agent-session.sh my-agent-1 -- ./run-agent.sh\nFor IDE hooks: agent-event.sh start > heartbeat (about once a minute) > waiting (when approval is needed) > done or failed; use one ID per session.": {
