    "The bridge is off by default. Only trust installed hooks: any local process that can open the URL scheme can send an event. Without a heartbeat, a session expires after 3 minutes. Agent events never trigger immediate sleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
